<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 2: </span><span id="A2.T2.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Model behavioral performance on <span id="A2.T2.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">FUGU</span> tasks</span>. See Figure <a href="#S2.F1" title="Figure 1 ‣ 2 Related Work ‣ Diagnosing Bottlenecks in Data Visualization Understanding by Vision-Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>A for examples of each task. For each task, model accuracy is averaged across sample size <math id="A2.T2.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\in\{1,2,4,8,16\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\in\{1,2,4,8,16\}</annotation></semantics></math>. The “<span id="A2.T2.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Avg.</span>” column gives accuracy averaged across all five tasks.</figcaption>
</figure>
