<br class="ltx_break">STEP 2: **State the color and shape of the data point with the smallest x-value**
<br class="ltx_break">BE CONCISE; ONLY RESPOND WITH THE ANSWER. The color and shape of the data point with the smallest x-value =

<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
</span>
