<span id="A3.T8.2.3.3.1.4" class="ltx_p">**Step 2: Identify the data point with the smallest x-value.**</span>
<span id="A3.T8.2.3.3.1.5" class="ltx_p">* The data point with the smallest x-value is the one with the lowest x-axis value, which is 0.</span>
